OL,3,GNEWSACall for more A1 central
OL,4,Areservation gaps to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincolnshire councillor is calling
OL,7,Ffor the closure of gaps in the A1
OL,8,Fcentral reservation to help improve
OL,9,Fsafety on the road.
OL,11,FCouncillor Elvis Stooke, who represents
OL,12,Fthe Belmont ward on South Kesteven
OL,13,FDistrict Council, said too many
OL,14,Faccidents were happening at crossing
OL,15,Fpoints and he believed they should be
OL,16,Fshut immediately.
OL,18,FNational Highways closed 14 crossing
OL,19,Fpoints last year and has plans for more
OL,20,Fclosures along the route.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
