OL,3,GNEWSACall for more A1 central
OL,4,Areservation gaps to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FA further 41 gaps remain open between
OL,7,FStamford and Newark, but National
OL,8,FHighways said closing them was a
OL,9,Fcomplex legal and technical process.
